SUMMARY:Heidi Gallery Exhibit: Pride-Full
DESCRIPTION:Pride Exhibition\nPride-Full 2026 highlights the fearless work of LGBTQ+ artists and their allies.\nArt that refuses to shrink\, soften\, or sanitize the human experience. Work that speaks to each of us and fills the space with the raw\, the radiant\, the political\, the messy\, the joyful\, and the defiant.\nJoin us in celebrating Pride through art that reflects authenticity\, courage\, and community.\nOpening Reception\nThursday\, May 28\, 2026\, 6pm-8pm \nWorkshop\nThe Ingredients of Connection\nSunday\, June 28\, 2026\, 11am-1pm\nA Storytelling and Active Listening Workshop\nArtist Walk & Talk and Closing\nSunday\, June 28\, 2026\, 2pm-4pm \nPride-Full 2026 graphic\nArtist List\nKai Aaron | Hunter Arevalo | Fenway Belle | Terri Binder | Janet Boltax | Cat Delett | Debbie Gibbs | Tricia Goginsky | Donald Haberman | Ellen Hark | Hope Hartman | Manman Huang | Kristen Iannuzzelli | Logan Jancerak | Aida Jones | Joyce Kaffel | Beth Kearney | Kathryn Keller | Lisa Lackey | Maria Lupo | Jeremy Moss | Tolu Olasoji | Joy Orie | Sonia Rapaport | Daniel Roa | Aviva Sakolsky | Mary Shadbolt | Marshall Sharpe | Kaya Simmons | Isabell Villacis \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/heidi-gallery-exhibit-pride-full/2026-05-28/
