SUMMARY:Songs and Snacks with Cantor at Temple Sholom
DESCRIPTION:Temple Sholom of West Essex will host a joyful\, family-friendly morning program\, “Songs and Snacks with Cantor Wright\,” on May 31 at 10 a.m. The event welcomes moms\, dads\, caring adults\, and their preschool through third-grade children for an engaging experience filled with music\, movement\, and community spirit. Come with your little one and bring some friends! Designed to introduce young children and their families to the warmth of synagogue life. Registration requested at www.sholom.net. Temple Sholom is located at 760 Pompton Ave. Cedar Grove\, NJ. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
