SUMMARY:ONCES Club: Work & Play Camp
DESCRIPTION:ONCES Club and RecRoom are coming together to create a space where parents can stay productive nearby while kids enjoy their own engaging morning filled with creativity\, movement\, play\, and connection. \nWhile you answer emails\, take meetings\, or finally catch up on work\, kids will rotate through a curated series of activities including: \n🎨 Paint & Sip Studio \n🔬 Slime Lab \n🧱 Independent Play & Build Zone \n🏆 The ONCES Challenge \n📖 Story Lounge & Wind Down Time \nThis is not your typical camp or drop-off program. Work & Play Camp was designed to feel intentional\, social\, creative\, and fun for both kids and parents. Recommended for elementary school ages 5–12. \nHosted in partnership with RecRoom; Montclair’s coworking space for productivity\, creativity\, and community; parents will receive access to a Rec Room day pass during the event\, giving them the opportunity to work from the space\, enjoy the environment\, and experience the community while their kids participate nearby at ONCES Club. \nWhether you work remotely\, freelance\, run your own business\, or simply need support during school-off days\, this experience was created with you in mind. \nMembers\, check your portal for a special link with a discounted rate! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/onces-club-work-play-camp/
LOCATION:RecRoom\, 1 Lackawanna Plaza\, Ste. 6\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
