SUMMARY:Rock Voices Montclair: Three Open-House Opportunities - come sing with our Community Rock Choir!
DESCRIPTION:If you’ve been missing how much fun it is to sing with other people – or always wanted to try it out for the first time – come check out Rock Voices Montclair as we get our Summer 2026 “MUSIC FROM THE MOVIES” Season started! \nWe are a fun and friendly community choir for adults – with an emphasis on community – and we sing only ROCK\, pop\, and other contemporary music. There are never any auditions required to join\, and ALL ARE WELCOME. Rock Voices has 35+ chapters across the Northeast US and Portland\, and we’ve been making music in Montclair since the Fall of 2023. \nWe rehearse on Tuesday nights from 7-9pm in Montclair\, with our next season starting on May 19th\, and a Summer Concert in August. Enrollment for the season is open through June 8th. (We also record all of our rehearsals\, so if you’ve already got some warm-weather vacay plans in the mix\, no worries at all – we’ve got you covered with as many replays as needed!) \nThis season’s Open House Rehearsal dates are 5/19\, 5/26\, and 6/2 – please join us at one\, two\, or all three\, as we start our 12-week session. There’s no obligation with these Open Houses\, so just come hang out with us – have some snacks\, make some new friends\, sing some songs you probably know…and see what you think! \nYou can check out our full set list for the season at www.RockVoices.com – and you can sign up there too\, just so we know to look out for you\, and to have enough sheet music (and snacks!) ready. Plus it’ll be faster than waiting in line to do it when you get there. \nHere’s our direct link: https://rockvoices.com/choir_location/montclair-nj/ \nPlease follow us on FB\, IG\, and YouTube @RockVoicesMontclairNJ to learn more about us\, and to find our FB event page and Enrollment FAQs too – we hope to sing with you soon! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n